## Successor F3 re-audit — 2026-07-26

This is the successor final-wave review. The two prior REJECT verdicts relied
on the premise that register-time candidates must all be labeled Local. That
premise is invalid: the established invariant, now pinned by
`TestControlStateRegisterCandidateSourceLabels`, is LocalV4/LocalV6 -> Local
and PublicV4/PublicV6 -> STUN. The pre-plan source already used that mapping.

```text
$ go test -race -count=1 ./mtypes ./device -run 'Test(ControlV2Parameters|SuperConfigV2|SuperSTUN|ReceiveDemultiplexesSTUN)'
